{
  "dom_id": "step-e5070",
  "name": "Example: Determining the Lengths of the Semi-Minor Axis of an Ellipse",
  "problem": "What are the lengths of the minor and semi-minor axes of the ellipse given below?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14275040/assets/aa8a140b32f6828f8b9b36849a82a291fa5ab2ac344804af58413fdf89f37ebb.png)",
  "worked_solution": "The major axis is the longest diameter of the ellipse, which is the line segment bounded by the points $(-3, -1)$  and $(7, -1).$ So, the length of the major axis is $7-(-3)=10.$ \n\nThe length of the semi-minor axis is half the length of the minor axis.\n\n- The minor axis is the shortest diameter of the ellipse, which is the line segment bounded by the points $(2,2)$ and $(2,-4).$ So, the length of the minor axis is $2-(-4)=6.$\n\n- The length of the semi-minor axis, then, is $\\dfrac{6}{2}=3.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e5070\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Determining the Lengths of the Semi-Minor Axis of an Ellipse</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e5070\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <p>What are the lengths of the minor and semi-minor axes of the ellipse given below?</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-0c1da2b02c8beeffeaf54b2bdd689d3c\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/0c1da2b02c8beeffeaf54b2bdd689d3c\"></div>\n                    </div>     \n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                    